  "title": "Traditional Beef Samosas",
  "description": "Coriander, garam masala, and cumin are just a preview of the many spices that flavor these beef samosas made with wonton wrappers.",
  "authors": [
    "CaraMeg"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-02-19T01:50:29-05:00",
